(shared lathe tool-tip / nose-radius compensation - TURN ON)
(emits LinuxCNC dynamic cutter comp using the diameter/orientation already)
(computed by o<tip_comp_dia> into #<_tip_comp_d> / #<_tip_comp_l>. Call this)
(right at the entry point, after a straight lead-in at least the nose radius)
(long, and cancel with o<tip_comp_off> - G40 - before any retract or plane)
(switch. Guarded on a real diameter so nose-comp-off passes emit nothing)
(CALL side[1])
(side : 42 = comp right of travel - G42.1, material on the left of travel;)
(  41 = comp left of travel - G41.1, material on the right. Pass the op's)
(  own already-correct direction value, do not re-derive it here)
o<tip_comp_on> sub
	#<side> = #1
	o<tc_on> if [#<_tip_comp_d> GT 0.0001]
		o<tc_side> if [#<side> EQ 42]
			G42.1 D#<_tip_comp_d> L#<_tip_comp_l>
		o<tc_side> else
			G41.1 D#<_tip_comp_d> L#<_tip_comp_l>
		o<tc_side> endif
	o<tc_on> endif
o<tip_comp_on> endsub
